    </nav>

  </header>


  <!-- =====================================================
       HERO
  ====================================================== -->

  <section class="hero">

    <div class="hero-inner">

      <div class="hero-label">
        HABITAT IAS • JPSC JHARKHAND SPECIAL
      </div>

      <h1>
        Understand
        <span>Jharkhand.</span>
      </h1>

      <p>
        A focused JPSC resource covering the history, geography,
        tribes, culture, economy, land laws, government schemes
        and other state-specific areas that form an important
        part of Jharkhand-focused examination preparation.
      </p>

      <div class="hero-actions">

        <a
          href="#areas"
          class="button primary"
        >
          Explore Jharkhand Topics →
        </a>

        <a
          href="/pyq/"
          class="button secondary"
        >
          Explore JPSC PYQs
        </a>

      </div>

    </div>

  </section>


  <!-- =====================================================
       CORE AREAS
  ====================================================== -->

  <section
    class="section"
    id="areas"
  >

    <div class="heading">

      <div class="section-label">
        JHARKHAND SPECIAL
      </div>

      <h2>
        Cover the state from multiple dimensions.
      </h2>

      <p>
        Jharkhand preparation requires more than memorising
        isolated facts. Study the state through interconnected
        historical, geographical, social, economic, legal and
        administrative dimensions.
      </p>

    </div>


    <div class="area-grid">

      {
        sections.map((section) => (

          <article class="area-card">

            <div class="area-icon">
              {section.icon}
            </div>

            <h3>
              {section.title}
            </h3>

            <p>
              {section.description}
            </p>

            <a
              href={section.link}
              class="area-link"
            >
              Explore Section →
            </a>

          </article>

        ))
      }

    </div>

  </section>


  <!-- =====================================================
       HISTORY
  ====================================================== -->

  <section
    class="section"
    id="history"
  >

    <div class="heading">

      <div class="section-label">
        HISTORY
      </div>

      <h2>
        Jharkhand through its historical development.
      </h2>

      <p>
        Study the historical evolution of the region, important
        tribal movements, colonial developments, personalities
        and the political processes that contributed to the
        formation of the modern state.
      </p>

    </div>


    <div class="focus-box">

      <h3>
        Important preparation areas
      </h3>

      <p>
        Detailed notes and PYQ-linked content can be organised
        around the following themes.
      </p>

      <div class="focus-list">

        <span class="focus-item">
          Ancient Jharkhand
        </span>

        <span class="focus-item">
          Medieval Jharkhand
        </span>

        <span class="focus-item">
          Colonial Period
        </span>

        <span class="focus-item">
          Tribal Movements
        </span>

        <span class="focus-item">
          Birsa Munda
        </span>

        <span class="focus-item">
          Santhal Hul
        </span>

        <span class="focus-item">
          Tana Bhagat Movement
        </span>

        <span class="focus-item">
          Jharkhand Movement
        </span>

        <span class="focus-item">
          State Formation
        </span>

      </div>

    </div>

  </section>


  <!-- =====================================================
       GEOGRAPHY
  ====================================================== -->

  <section
    class="section focus-section"
    id="geography"
  >

    <div class="heading">

      <div class="section-label">
        GEOGRAPHY
      </div>

      <h2>
        Physical and economic geography of Jharkhand.
      </h2>

      <p>
        Understand how relief, geology, climate, drainage,
        forests, minerals, agriculture and human activities
        interact across the state.
      </p>

    </div>


    <div class="focus-box">

      <h3>
        Major geography dimensions
      </h3>

      <p>
        Geography preparation should connect physical features
        with resources, population, agriculture, industries and
        regional development.
      </p>

      <div class="focus-list">

        <span class="focus-item">
          Physiography
        </span>

        <span class="focus-item">
          Chotanagpur Plateau
        </span>

        <span class="focus-item">
          Santhal Pargana
        </span>

        <span class="focus-item">
          Rivers
        </span>

        <span class="focus-item">
          Climate
        </span>

        <span class="focus-item">
          Soils
        </span>

        <span class="focus-item">
          Forests
        </span>

        <span class="focus-item">
          Minerals
        </span>

        <span class="focus-item">
          Agriculture
        </span>

        <span class="focus-item">
          Industries
        </span>

        <span class="focus-item">
          District Geography
        </span>

      </div>

    </div>

  </section>


  <!-- =====================================================
       TRIBES & CULTURE
  ====================================================== -->

  <section
    class="section"
    id="tribes"
  >

    <div class="heading">

      <div class="section-label">
        TRIBES & CULTURE
      </div>

      <h2>
        Society, tribes, traditions and cultural identity.
      </h2>

      <p>
        Jharkhand's tribal communities and cultural traditions
        are an important dimension of state-specific preparation.
      </p>

    </div>


    <div class="connection-grid">

      <article class="connection-card">

        <div class="connection-number">
          01
        </div>

        <h3>
          Tribal Communities
        </h3>

        <p>
          Study major tribal communities, their distribution,
          social organisation, traditions and important
          characteristics.
        </p>

      </article>


      <article class="connection-card">

        <div class="connection-number">
          02
        </div>

        <h3>
          Festivals & Traditions
        </h3>

        <p>
          Understand important festivals, customs, rituals,
          dances, music and traditional practices.
        </p>

      </article>


      <article class="connection-card">

        <div class="connection-number">
          03
        </div>

        <h3>
          Literature & Language
        </h3>

        <p>
          Cover important languages, folk literature, writers,
          literary traditions and cultural expressions.
        </p>

      </article>

    </div>

  </section>


